    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This vegan coconut soup serves 4 and takes about 25 minutes. The broth is built on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "coconut milk",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coconut-milk"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "lemongrass",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lemongrass"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "galangal",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "galangal"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Firm tofu",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tofu-firm"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and mushrooms (sliced chestnut or shiitake, no slug, add 200 g sliced to the broth) replace the chicken. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Light soy sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soy-sauce-light"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " replaces fish sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Keep the soup at a low simmer once the coconut milk goes in. Boiling causes the milk to split and the broth becomes oily and grainy."
          }
        ]
      },
